{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act13side_level_act13side_07_end",
  "groupId": "act13side",
  "stageId": "act13side_07",
  "title": "夢的餘韻",
  "storyCode": "NL-7",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "33dd132df904e57273930b380bf0356d888282b7532b1f21ce1936503aa15cde",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔2 7-2"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "......小灰！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "text": "......索娜，你沒事！太好了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "你騙過了羅伊？不錯的演技嘛，怎麼做到的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "text": "......只是想像了一下我如果真的失去你，會是什麼感受。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "哇哦，體驗派......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "其他人呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "text": "......艾沃娜受傷很重......但好在沒有大礙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "......艾沃娜她......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“正義騎士號”",
      "text": "（低沉的滴滴聲）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "text": "她是我們中最像個戰士的......她站到了最後。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "text": "查絲汀娜和塑膠騎士去對付白金大位了......我們得去幫他們！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "text": "......不必了，白金已經撤退了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "text": "我們還沒有淪落到兩個人都打不退她的地步，她沒那麼強。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "text": "......查絲汀娜呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "text": "今天的賽事必須正常進行，沒問題吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "text": "我們已經確認好特錦賽賽場萬無一失。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "text": "好。安撫觀眾的情緒，今晚的比賽必須完美無缺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "text": "記住，不光是觀眾......經歷了之前的騷動後，幾位常務董事也對今晚的比賽分外關注。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "text": "表現好的話，我們都會得到嘉獎，否則......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "text": "明白！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "text": "唉，辛苦你了，莫布。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "不！能負責今晚的解說，是我的榮幸——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "text": "不用說你應該也知道，就當昨晚的事情沒發生過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "text": "今晚的四場比賽裡，最受關注的，無疑是耀騎士和逐魘騎士的對決。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "text": "但是......在感染者引發了這種規模的異常事件後，董事會不太希望耀騎士繼續獲勝了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "......是想讓裁判席吹黑哨嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "text": "這一點，我們會根據賽況自行判斷，但是，你需要在裁判席作出判決後，向觀眾“傳達”其合理性。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "text": "血騎士那邊，已經有人去赤盞騎士團做思想工作，應該很快就能得出結論。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "text": "而這一邊......耀騎士和逐魘騎士......只是兩個瘋子罷了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "明白！我這就去做賽前準備！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "text": "怎麼了？你的臉色很蒼白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "text": "......玄鐵在大停電之後就消失了。三個人，都消失了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "text": "雖然秘而不發，但是有數位聯合會高階主管在大停電期間遭到了刺殺......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "text": "現場很倉促，線索指向了感染者，但是......我不這麼認為，感染者有這麼大能耐嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "text": "現在，有一件很恐怖的事情在悄然發生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "text": "難道說......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "text": "......是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "text": "無胄盟背叛了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "......巴特巴雅爾，你平時無事可做嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "你問我這話嗎！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "......你啊，是進入了特錦賽的騎士吧？沒有訓練場地，甚至都無家可歸，每天就在大騎士領當流浪漢嗎！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "......當一個獵人，在森林裡迷失方向的時候，他會自行生活，搭建木棚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "你可是在一座大地上屈指可數的大城市裡......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "——城市！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "異樣的咆哮聲令老騎士一時無言。\n周遭的目光聚集在兩人身上，彷彿他們才是森林裡的野獸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "城市......是懦弱的象徵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "被稱作文明的東西在征服蠻荒之後，建立起了自己的高樓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "在這座高樓裡，不再需要人性做門票。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "......你在說什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "......卡瓦萊利亞基有值得一戰的戰士，值得我，將性命託付於命運的戰士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "可他們，都在反抗這座城市。順從的大都羸弱，反抗者永垂不朽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "這正是“文明”已經腐敗墮落的象徵，騎士，應當回到那個血與榮耀的時代。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "......你活在過去，孩子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "......我活得光榮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "希望今晚，我能真正感受到那個未曾遠去的時代。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "那我也不多勸你什麼了，瑪嘉烈是不會輸的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "......她身上有英雄的氣息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "但願她還沒被這個碌碌無為的時代洗去鋒芒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "歡迎來到特錦賽現場！歡迎來到今夜的卡西米爾騎士特別錦標賽！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "隨著比賽推進，已經有無數觀眾參與到了賽事中來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "在今天，我也榮幸地宣佈，本屆特錦賽的累計觀看人數、獎池與活動總金額，再次突破了歷史之最！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "毫無疑問！時代仍在發展，屬於卡西米爾的未來依舊熠熠生輝！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "真的不能去現場看比賽嗎？姐姐應該有參賽者內部門票吧......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "傻丫頭，你想再被無胄盟襲擊一次嗎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "嗚......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......我們已經和無胄盟公開敵對了，你知道這意味著什麼嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "我們不能太高調地露面，要是繼續對抗下去，能不能留在大騎士領都是未知數。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......說真的，我都不知道為什麼事情會走到這一步......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手騎士",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "text": "......唔，這不是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手騎士",
      "text": "......恰爾內的跟班嗎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "text": "您好，泰特斯閣下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手騎士",
      "text": "坐吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手騎士",
      "text": "當上發言人之後意氣風發，哼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "text": "......沒有的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手騎士",
      "text": "在那種情形下，突然臨危受命，你就不覺得奇怪嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "text": "......恰爾內先生走得匆忙，很多事情我都沒來得及問他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手騎士",
      "text": "你想問嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手騎士",
      "text": "我在聯合會裡有一些人脈......如果你不方便，我可以幫你問到恰爾內的流放地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手騎士",
      "text": "別誤會，再輸給耀騎士一次讓我意識到了一件事，我已經不再是那個靠一隻手打敗七名騎士的泰特斯·白楊了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手騎士",
      "text": "在退役前，我總得和你們這些發言人攀上人情......幹嘛擺出那副表情？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "text": "......說實在的，我只是沒有想到，堂堂鋒盔騎士團主力，曾一度有希望進軍四強，摘得大騎士封號的您......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "text": "也會有主動提到退役的一天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "text": "賽場上的您......是那麼的......孤傲，我本以為您......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手騎士",
      "text": "做競技騎士是很悲劇的，馬克維茨。在場外，我們也是人，也要為自己謀退路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手騎士",
      "text": "能四肢健全地戰鬥到今天，已經該知足了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手騎士",
      "text": "理想結束了，馬克維茨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "今天對決的兩位，都大有來頭！不僅如此，這也是數屆特錦賽都未曾見過的，獨立騎士間的對決！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "沒有企業贊助！沒有騎士團的訓練與扶持！只靠自己給盔甲拋光，打磨武器！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "但是，他們依舊站上了特錦賽的賽場，不僅如此，其中更是有曾經的冠軍，萬眾矚目的復活王者！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "有請，年輕的傳奇，來自臨光家族的冠軍，耀騎士瑪嘉烈·臨光！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "而另一邊，哦，只存在於歷史書之中的種族，稀少的庫蘭塔，鞭笞舊時代的戰神後裔——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "即使放眼漫長的騎士競技歷史，也僅此一位的特例，純粹的血統，純粹的恐怖與強大！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "來——自草原深處的獨行俠，最後的怯薛，逐魘騎士拓拉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "這是——夢魘的號角！大戰一觸即發！冠軍是否會敗在古老種族的手下！？還是復甦的征途會被耀騎士斬斷！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "讓我們——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "耀騎士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "哦哦？逐魘騎士突然將長槍插在了地上，他......他在做什麼，在行禮嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "我等待這一刻......等待太久。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "卡西米爾的騎士令人失望太深，太深了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......我聽弗格瓦爾德師傅提起過你，逐魘騎士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "你在尋找什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "......尋找我的天命，天馬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "我古老的族人奉行傳統，在成年之時踏上未知的天途......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "......沒有任何人知道在天途上等待自己的是什麼，但只有完成這趟旅途，人生才算真正地開始。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "與野獸廝殺也好，見聞異國異事也罷，每一個走完天途的夢魘，都將意識到自己天途的意義——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "隨後，他們成為恐懼的胚芽，踏過萬水千山，將征服散播。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "只有熟知這片大地，我們才能熟知自己的命運。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "你找到你的天途的意義了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "......還沒有，天馬。我的前路......如同被迷霧縈繞的森林。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "我多麼希望，你，就是我的意義。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "來吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "text": "......你們，是塑膠......是瑟奇亞克的家人嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "平靜的女人",
      "text": "......你是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "text": "我是......騎士。他的騎士朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "text": "......你們......沒有遭受什麼......虐待嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "平靜的女人",
      "text": "虐待？我不明白你在說什麼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "平靜的女人",
      "text": "那天瑟奇亞克突然倒下，有一個白衣的騎士告訴我們，他是被賽場上的仇家陷害了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "平靜的女人",
      "text": "然後，她讓我們躲藏在這裡......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "text": "......這是，瑟奇亞克給我的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "平靜的女人",
      "text": "......！這是，我送給他的木雕......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "平靜的女人",
      "text": "他在哪裡？他還好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "text": "......我帶你去見他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "......做個交易吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "只要你答應我，今夜之後，不要再和無胄盟為敵，我可以把你的妻兒在哪告訴你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "text": "......什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "還有你，遠牙，轉告紅松騎士團的每個人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "無胄盟內部出了些問題，我也察覺得到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "沒有人想平白無故地被人利用，吃力不討好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "text": "......難以相信。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "text": "你能代表無胄盟的集體意志嗎？雖說是白金大位——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "但終歸只是個中層管理，對吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "你說的沒錯......大部分無胄盟畢竟是被聯合會雇來的，我只是代為管理......沒有人能阻攔董事會的意圖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "但如果大位們都按兵不動，你們也能輕鬆許多吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "畢竟董事會這些年有些急於求成，招來的新兵水準都參差不齊的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亞克",
      "text": "......什麼？破壞電力設施的是無胄盟？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "......羅伊似乎還摧毀了伺服器機庫，嫁禍給了我們......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "無胄盟......難道是想擺脫董事會的掌控？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "text": "......嘁！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "text": "從一開始，我們就在被利用嗎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "text": "我們的戰鬥，我們的犧牲，都是為了——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“正義騎士號”",
      "text": "（低沉的滴滴聲）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "text": "......抱歉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "......不。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "燭騎士救下我之後，我見到了伊奧萊塔·羅素。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "text": "——大騎士長！？你見到了大騎士長本人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "啊哈哈，比報紙和電視新聞上要年輕一些和藹一些呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "她同意給我們......爭取回合法的身份了，我們的交易還算數。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "小灰，晶片在你手上嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "text": "......當然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "text": "但是......事已至此......輿論把所有的事件都歸結給了感染者......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "text": "索娜，所謂的“合法”身份，真的還有意義嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "我簡直無法用語言來形容此刻的心情——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "耀騎士的強大已經為人所熟知，但是逐魘騎士！這位承載著古老過去的戰士！他展露出了怎樣高超的技藝！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "簡直不可思議！雙方沒有使用什麼複雜的源石技藝，純粹的武藝，純粹的武器對抗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "比任何動作電影都要誇張，如雷電般的身法，有力的劈砍！僅僅開賽十分鐘！賽場就滿目瘡痍！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的觀眾",
      "text": "看呐，逐魘騎士的動作！毫無疑問，他是冠軍級的選手！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聒噪的觀眾",
      "text": "我就知道他大有可為！我花了四百枚金幣在他身上！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "text": "......真是一場出色的比賽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手騎士",
      "text": "......那個夢魘使用武器的技巧，我從未見過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手騎士",
      "text": "類似征戰騎士，又不太一樣......唔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "text": "怎麼了？左手騎士閣下？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手騎士",
      "text": "......似乎有一位意想不到的觀眾出現了......看來那晚的傳言是真的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "text": "您是說——呃——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "]\n在觀眾席最靠後的角落裡，佇立著一抹銀光。\n即使他的存在感無與倫比，此刻，也被觀眾的歡呼與驚叫聲淹沒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銀槍的天馬”",
      "text": "......如此之近的距離觀看特錦賽，還是頭一次。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銀槍的天馬”",
      "text": "真是......令人作嘔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊奧萊塔·羅素",
      "text": "是什麼令你反感呢，萊姆？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銀槍的天馬”",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊奧萊塔·羅素",
      "text": "原來如此，我知道你的答案了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊奧萊塔·羅素",
      "text": "那麼，在你看來，場上這兩位騎士，夢魘和天馬，他們實力如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銀槍的天馬”",
      "text": "......不得不承認，確實是精彩的武藝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銀槍的天馬”",
      "text": "那匹夢魘並非久經沙場的戰將，但是某種執念幾乎催生他成為一名真正的戰士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銀槍的天馬”",
      "text": "至於瑪嘉烈......嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊奧萊塔·羅素",
      "text": "......怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銀槍的天馬”",
      "text": "您應該比我更敏銳，宗師。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銀槍的天馬”",
      "text": "她與過去......大不相同了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "——呼——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "嘶......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "酣暢淋漓的對招戛然而止，風暴般的動作終於第一次停下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "這兩人不需要呼吸的嗎！？這是常人能做出的動作嗎！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "......漂亮的劍術，天馬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "承讓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "......你讓人......無比激動。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "你知道嗎，傳說中，可汗曾在年輕時敗給過一匹流淌著金色血液的天馬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "......我很好奇，這世上真的有流淌著金色血液的庫蘭塔存在嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "很遺憾，我臉頰上的血，只是普通的紅色。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "......熱身結束了，耀騎士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "既然你並非浪得虛名——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "空氣在凝固。\n等到回過神來，才發現是自己忘記了呼吸。\n恐懼？\n為什麼自己會感到恐懼？\n在場的每一個觀眾......每一個騎士，都感到了某種異樣的壓抑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "——那就讓現實為我讓道吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耀騎士",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "瑪嘉烈這是第一次，在賽場上下意識地使用了法術。\n劇烈的光芒如同太陽的子嗣，照亮著無邊黑夜。\n可就算光芒耀眼，年輕的夢魘，也沒有動搖半步。\n騎士競技，顧名思義，只是競技。\n但瑪嘉烈在一瞬間感到了什麼，那是她曾在那些最強大的敵人身上感到的氣息。\n天災，感染者的哀嚎、怒吼，反抗者的血，垂死的掙扎。\n年輕的夢魘並沒有親歷過屍山血海。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "但他的血統令他先天懂得支配恐懼。\n純正的血統。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "......（古老的語言）年輕的獵人踏上天途♪從夢裡出發，去往黃金的彼岸♪",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "（古老的語言）手持血親之血染紅的長戟♪淹沒在猩紅的哀傷中♪",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "悲壯的歌聲。\n講述一個古老的故事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "......哈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "——呃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "發、發生了什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "這是某種法術嗎！？施放了某種源石技藝之後，賽場上所有人——都感到了——呃，說不上來的感覺！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "但是！逐魘騎士一個踏步就激起了一層氣浪，拍打在人造的石塊上！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "何等凌厲的一槍！耀騎士竟然——狼狽地後退了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "連冠軍都可以擊退的一擊！斥退光芒的一擊！再閃耀的光輝，難道也抵擋不住夢魘的侵襲嗎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "text": "......沒有歡呼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "text": "人們都沉浸在......這種情緒裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手騎士",
      "text": "......那一槍......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "text": "您看出什麼門道了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手騎士",
      "text": "......換作一般的騎士......必死無疑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "text": "呃？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手騎士",
      "text": "......他是來真的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銀槍的天馬”",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銀槍的天馬”",
      "text": "......貨真價實。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊奧萊塔·羅素",
      "text": "......只是個迷途的孩子罷了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊奧萊塔·羅素",
      "text": "真可憐啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊奧萊塔·羅素",
      "text": "怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "（什麼！？這麼突然 ？你確定？呃......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "突發狀況！逐魘騎士......剛才施放的法術，被認為影響到了觀眾和裁判！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "這明確違反了騎士競技規則第三條與第七條！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "“競技騎士不得以任何形式傷害或威脅觀眾的人身財產安全”以及“競技騎士不得以任何形式干擾裁判的主觀判斷”！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "（該死，我自己說出來都覺得牽強，他們就不能挑個好點的時機嗎！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "本場比賽宣告終止——！所以——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "——來吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......光啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "匯聚吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "怎、怎麼回事！兩位騎士彷彿沒有聽到這裁決一般！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "比賽已經中止！請兩位騎士立刻分開，等待裁判團判決！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "哈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "啊......！多美的一劍......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "在轉瞬之間......在刀尖即將劈開你的頭顱時還能做出反擊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "你見識過生死，你見識過殘酷的事物，你根本不會為恐懼動搖，不會因我而動搖！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "強大的敵人和不可戰勝的困難並不恐怖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "相較之下，這座城市此刻流露出的麻木與自甘墮落，要比你恐怖得多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "誰來阻止這兩個人！快把他們拉開！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "如今的卡西米爾確實令人厭惡——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "——來吧，恐懼將讓這些圍觀者知道，他們所觀賞的，究竟是什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "到此為止。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "——什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一道血影撕裂了大地。\n二人之間的地面被一把突兀出現的巨斧切割。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我說，到此為止。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......比賽已經結束了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......你是......血騎士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "誰能想到——最後制止了無法停下的戰局的人！竟然是——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "“卡西米爾的赤色高腳杯”，英雄！狄開俄波利斯！當然這個名字太難記了，但是請千萬不要錯過這個畫面——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "卡西米爾特錦賽冠軍，目前毫無疑問的人氣第一，來自米諾斯的戰神——血——騎士——！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "（天呐，還好血騎士出現了，今天的節目效果應該還可以吧？喂？你們誰去看著點發言人的表情？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銀槍的天馬”",
      "text": "......狄開俄波利斯，米諾斯人的名字，他就是三年前那個奪冠的感染者？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "text": "......我也是第一次在現場看見血騎士出手......氣勢非凡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手騎士",
      "text": "......哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血騎士",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "哦哦！血騎士跳下了賽場！走向了剛剛還戰作一團的兩人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "卡西米爾——已經多少年沒有出現的畫面！！兩位冠軍！兩位冠軍同時在場！這是何等熱血沸騰的一幕！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "當然，當然，站在另一邊的也不是等閒之輩，方才展露出了強大的實力，同時，也是卡西米爾最後的夢魘——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "光是這一幕！就價值千金！請所有人不要忘記這個時刻，這是註定能載入史冊的時刻！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "......你，也是冠軍......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血騎士",
      "text": "你的下一個對手是我，夢魘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血騎士",
      "text": "而我的下一個對手，是你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "......呵......哈哈......你就像在說，我一定會敗給你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血騎士",
      "text": "當然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血騎士",
      "text": "一個過去的幻影，憑什麼戰勝我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血騎士",
      "text": "你，感染者，我等著與你決戰的那一天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "......你想就這麼一走了之嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血騎士",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魘騎士",
      "text": "——唔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血騎士",
      "text": "夢魘，你應該好好學學，能讓人感到恐懼的，永遠只有“現在”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "text": "（那個角度，竟然擋開了......？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血騎士",
      "text": "我們賽場上見。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耀騎士",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "瑪嘉烈轉頭看向被巨斧劈開的地面。\n血騎士是來拿回他的斧子的。\n毫無生機的地表龜裂處，彷彿，滲出了血液。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
